== Description ==

'''Bullet Shell''' is an ammunition component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 30 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[D45 Chrome]], [[5.56x45mm Chrome]], [[7.62x39mm Chrome]], [[9x19mm Chrome]], [[7.62x39mm Titanium]], [[7.62x51mm Titanium]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

